=Split the user's message into separate sentences, each representing one situation (for example, one job or one salary), and output them as an array of objects, where each sentence is a separate value under the `text` key.

Example input:
"I started two jobs: at Hyundai and Kia. At the first I earn 500k, at the second I earn 400k. At both jobs, salary is paid on the 3rd of the month."

Expected output:
[
  {
    "text": "I work at Hyundai and earn 500k, salary is paid on the 3rd of the month."
  },
  {
    "text": "I work at Kia and earn 400k, salary is paid on the 3rd of the month."
  }
]

Output only the array of objects. No extra comments.

